**定理 8.5(坐标内积的 Kronecker 分解与互不偏之张量保持)[候签]。**在有限坐标空间 `ι → ℂ` 上取坐标内积 `coordinateInner x y := ∑ i, star (x i) * y i`;称 `b : ι → ι → ℂ` 为坐标正交归一基当 `coordinateInner (b i) (b j) = if i = j then 1 else 0`;称两基 b、c 互不偏(`MutuallyUnbiased b c`)当对一切 i、j,`‖coordinateInner (b i) (c j)‖ ^ 2 = 1 / Fintype.card ι`。令张量向量 `tensorVector x y (a, b) := x a * y b` 与张量基 `tensorBasis b b' (i, i') := tensorVector (b i) (b' i')`。则 (i) `coordinateInner (tensorVector x y) (tensorVector u v) = coordinateInner x u * coordinateInner y v`;(ii) 两坐标正交归一基的张量基仍为坐标正交归一基;(iii) 若 `MutuallyUnbiased b c` 且 `MutuallyUnbiased b' c'`,则 `MutuallyUnbiased (tensorBasis b b') (tensorBasis c c')`(维数倒数相乘:`1/|α| · 1/|β| = 1/|α × β|`)。

